# Rainmeter 直接读取的文件必须是 UTF-16 LE BOM；
# 让 Git 以 UTF-8 存储（GitHub 上可读、可 diff），检出时自动转回 UTF-16
*.ini text working-tree-encoding=UTF-16LE-BOM
*.inc text working-tree-encoding=UTF-16LE-BOM
@Resources/Scripts/Calendar.lua text working-tree-encoding=UTF-16LE-BOM
@Resources/Scripts/Settings.lua text working-tree-encoding=UTF-16LE-BOM

# 例外：这两个文件本身是 UTF-8（仅被 Lua 读取，不经 Rainmeter 解析器）
@Resources/Configs/Default.inc text
@Resources/Scripts/Common.lua text

# 二进制资源
*.jpg binary
*.exe binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
